  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "First, we write $24$ as a fraction:\n\n$$\n24=\\frac{24}{1}\n$$\n\nTo find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{24}{1}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{1}{24}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $24$ is $\\frac{1}{24}.$",
